# Templates & Core Blocks (Permanent)

## Law

**Data ≠ Template ≠ Document.** Templates hold layout/structure/bindings only — never Business content rows.

## Storage split (locked)

| Layer | Store | Contents |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Metadata | PostgreSQL `document_templates` | `business_id`, `name`, optional `theme_id`, soft-delete |
| Body | MongoDB `template_bodies` | Flow of blocks + page config; **always** `businessId` + `templateId` |

Do not put template page trees in PostgreSQL JSONB unless an ADR reverses this. Always filter Mongo by `businessId`.

## Core block registry (Phase 01)

Canonical types in `@vdb/document-schema` (`CORE_BLOCK_TYPES`):

| Type | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `text` | Flow text / bindings |
| `image` | Media asset ref |
| `section` | Nested flow container (`children`) |
| `divider` | Visual rule |
| `headerSlot` | Master header placeholder (filled in master-page phase) |
| `footerSlot` | Master footer placeholder |
| `qr` | QR code (`props` targetType/value/sizePx) — **core**; encode server-side for PDF — see ADR 011 |
| `toc` | Auto table of contents from section/text headings — **core**; logical page # — ADR 012 |
| `repeater` | Loop Business collection (`props.source` + card `children`) — **core**; ADR 013 |
| `gallery` | Album ref (`props.galleryId`) — **`module.gallery`** (Phase 02) |
| `map` | Leaflet/OSM map (`props` center/zoom/markersSource/…) — **`module.map`** (Phase 02) |
| `orgChart` | Org tree from Team (`props` layout/rootMemberId/…) — **`module.org_chart`** (Phase 02) |
| `timeline` | Company events (`props` layout vertical/alternating) — **`module.timeline`** (Phase 02) |

Unknown block types must **fail safely** at validate/render (reject or skip with audit) — never crash the worker.

## QR block (core)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Entitlement | None beyond document writable / membership for encode preview |
| Props | `targetType` (`url`\|`phone`\|`email`\|`map`\|`custom`), `value`, `sizePx`, optional `caption` |
| Payload | `buildQrPayload` in `@vdb/document-schema` |
| Encode | Server `qrcode` → PNG data URL — PDF + `POST .../qr/encode` (ADR 011) |
| Non-goal | Dynamic redirect / tracked short URLs |

## TOC block (core)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Entitlement | None beyond document writable |
| Sources | `section.title` + `text` with `headingLevel` 1–3 — see ADR 012 |
| Page numbers | **Logical** `pages[]` 1-based index (not print-sheet reflow) |
| Compute | `buildTableOfContents` in `@vdb/document-schema` — shared preview + PDF |
| Props | `maxLevel`, `showPageNumbers`, optional `title` |

## Repeater block (core)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Entitlement | Source-dependent: `projects` → `module.projects`; `timelineEvents` → `module.timeline`; else foundational |
| Props | `source`, `limit`, `emptyMessage`; **children** = card template |
| Binding | `{{item.<key>}}` (ADR 013) + document-level `{{business.name}}` / `{{count(...)}}` (ADR 016) — no eval |
| API | `GET .../collections/:source` for preview; export resolves same data |
| Nested | Nested `repeater` unsupported in MVP |

## Conditional visibility (Phase 02 — all blocks)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Field | Optional `when` on `BlockNode` (ADR 014) |
| Ops | `exists` \| `empty` \| `eq` only |
| Paths | `collection.<RepeaterSource>` → item count |
| Evaluate | Preview + PDF render; TOC skips hidden |
| Non-goal | AND/OR trees, formulas, entitlement conditions |

Sellable modules (Map, OrgChart, Gallery, …) register **additional** types with `moduleCode`; Core types have `moduleCode: null`. Full registry: `BLOCK_REGISTRY` in `@vdb/document-schema`.

## API

- Registry: `GET /api/businesses/:businessId/blocks` (membership)
- Templates CRUD under `/api/businesses/:businessId/templates`
- Mutate: `EntitlementGuard` + `@RequireWritable`
- Validate body with `parseTemplateBody` before Mongo write

## Schema version

Bump `DOCUMENT_SCHEMA_VERSION` / template schema in `packages/document-schema` on incompatible block/page shape changes; note in `docs/`.

## Documents (instances)

| Layer | Store | Contents |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Metadata | PostgreSQL `documents` | `business_id`, `title`, `status` (`draft`\|`published`), `template_id`, soft-delete |
| Body | MongoDB `document_bodies` | Validated `DocumentBody` with `businessId` + `documentId`; may hold `dataRefs` (not template content) |

Create-from-template **copies** block structure into the document body (snapshot). Later template edits do not mutate existing documents. Soft-delete: PG `deleted_at`; Mongo body removed (restore = recreate / future recycle bin).

## Document versions (Phase 03)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Metadata | PostgreSQL `document_versions` (`business_id`, `document_id`, `version_number`, `source`) |
| Body snapshot | MongoDB `document_version_bodies` — immutable copy; always filter `businessId` |
| Create | Auto on **publish**; manual `POST .../versions` |
| Published lock | `PATCH` body while `status` ∈ `review\|approved\|published` → conflict lock code (ADR 020/021) |
| Restore / clone | Restore → current body + draft; clone → **new** document |
| Compare MVP | Metadata/stats only — see ADR 020 |
| Approval | State machine draft→review→approved→published — see ADR 021; PDF export only approved/published |
| Comments | PG `document_comments` — see ADR 022; resolve; mentions out of MVP |
